<title>NETHERLANDS: NPM details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>NPM details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch venture capital firm NPM said on Wednesday it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 27 held.</p>
<p>In March, NPM announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 2.80 guilders. The payment could be taken up in cash or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>NPM shares closed at 74.90 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Tuesday.</p>
<p>NPM will propose the dividend payments to shareholders on May 16.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
